WEBVTT

00:01:20.060 --> 00:01:24.100
Old man! Bad news!

00:01:26.410 --> 00:01:28.060
They sure are noisy...

00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:30.570
Where did Joe go this time?

00:01:31.510 --> 00:01:33.570
I-It's terrible! Bro Joe...

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:36.570
We were watching TV... and Bro's in trouble...

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:43.620
And they say he's hurt really bad!

00:01:44.240 --> 00:01:45.620
Joe is!?

00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:48.130
We're not lying! It's true!

00:01:48.130 --> 00:01:52.630
We were watching TV at the noodle shop because we heard Rikiishi was on TV...

00:01:52.630 --> 00:01:57.750
Then we heard the announcer say that Wolf Kanagushi and Joe knocked each other out!

00:01:57.750 --> 00:01:59.880
It's true! It's true, I swear!

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:17.420
Hey! This way!

00:02:17.420 --> 00:02:19.030
Watch your step!

00:02:20.620 --> 00:02:23.080
Tange Danpei-san, are you in there?

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:23.620
Tange-san!

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:24.510
Oh, there he is!

00:02:24.510 --> 00:02:26.620
Better take a shot!

00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:30.620
I'm Tange.

00:02:30.620 --> 00:02:33.840
Congratulations! The boxing association commissioner...

00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:37.130
...has just approved of Coach Otaka of Asia Gym's demands!

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:41.640
In other words, he's permitting you to be issued a license!

00:02:42.320 --> 00:02:43.460
What did you say!?

00:02:43.460 --> 00:02:45.140
Issued a license?

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:47.240
Your fighter, Yabuki-kun, ain't half bad!

00:02:47.240 --> 00:02:50.960
He pulled off a lightning raid on the rookie champion Wolf Kanagushi!

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:53.110
This'll make headlines!

00:02:53.570 --> 00:02:55.920
<i>Throw this brat out of here!</i>

00:02:55.920 --> 00:02:56.680
<i>Wait!</i>

00:02:56.680 --> 00:02:57.110
<i>Coach!</i>

00:02:57.110 --> 00:03:00.120
<i>Let me handle this kid!</i>

00:03:02.210 --> 00:03:03.320
<i>I've been waiting for this moment!</i>

00:03:18.390 --> 00:03:19.590
<i>Wolf, stand up...</i>

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:21.910
<i>Wolf... Wolf...</i>

00:03:27.890 --> 00:03:31.390
So in order to restore Wolf Kanagushi's honor...

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:34.900
...there is no other choice than to have him face Yabuki-kun in the ring!

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:37.540
They're saying he's definitely gonna win in an official fight.

00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:40.880
Anyway, that's what Coach Otaka decided.

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:42.600
So Coach Tange, your thoughts?

00:03:42.600 --> 00:03:44.410
Well... uh...

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:48.370
By the way, just how powerful would you say Yabuki-kun is?

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:51.170
Say Wolf Kanagushi is a ten, how strong would Joe be?

00:03:51.170 --> 00:03:55.170
To put it bluntly, do you think you can train a fighter that has what it takes to beat Wolf Kanagushi?

00:03:57.490 --> 00:04:00.570
You're all so hasty...

00:04:00.570 --> 00:04:03.920
The only one who was authorized for a pro boxing license...

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:07.220
was Tange Gym, in other words, me.

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:09.560
In Joe and Nishi's case...

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:12.810
they have to take a tough test before they can become pros.

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:17.670
His fight with Kanagushi will depend on whether or not he passes the test.

00:04:22.460 --> 00:04:24.040
More importantly, Joe...

00:04:24.690 --> 00:04:26.230
Where is Joe?

00:04:29.380 --> 00:04:30.670
Joe!

00:04:31.170 --> 00:04:32.620
Bro!

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:44.150
Joe!

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:47.550
I'm fine, old man.

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:58.980
You're all so small...

00:05:02.700 --> 00:05:03.280
Joe!

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:10.070
I'm fine, Nishi.

00:05:10.070 --> 00:05:11.050
Let me go.

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:17.030
You see...

00:05:22.970 --> 00:05:27.550
I ain't worried about that wild jackal they call Wolf Kanagushi one bit.

00:05:31.050 --> 00:05:35.060
Tell Coach Otaka that if he has time to worry about me fighting Wolf...

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:38.690
he should tell the two other champions from Asia Gym

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:42.950
to be careful so they don't get beaten up by Yabuki Joe!

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:55.200
Joe!

00:05:56.970 --> 00:05:58.180
Even though he's taken so much damage...

00:05:58.180 --> 00:06:00.960
At the very least, he's got a mouth like Cassius Clay!

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:03.590
Seems like it'll be more fun to interview the man himself!

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:06.870
So Yabuki-kun, about today's incident...

00:06:06.870 --> 00:06:09.350
I'm sorry, but could you give him some space tonight?

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:14.360
Joe really had it out there!

00:06:14.360 --> 00:06:15.470
We have to treat to him!

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:16.310
Fine, fine...

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:18.000
Now, go! Go!

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:18.000
<i>Come on, go home!</i>

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:20.030
I pray to God that you keep fighting.

00:06:20.030 --> 00:06:23.310
Interviews with you will make our articles that much better!

00:06:23.310 --> 00:06:25.330
Please, just go home!

00:06:25.330 --> 00:06:26.820
Take care, Yabuki!

00:06:38.020 --> 00:06:39.100
Joe...

00:06:40.820 --> 00:06:43.000
This ain't good at all...

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:44.300
Here.

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:46.000
Joe, this is just like you...

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:47.350
Joe, this is just like you...

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:52.970
Oh, no! He lost consciousness!

00:06:54.670 --> 00:06:58.010
You built a bridge your own way!

00:07:17.090 --> 00:07:18.410
Old man!

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:43.260
Joe!

00:08:05.010 --> 00:08:06.380
Where's Joe?

00:08:07.870 --> 00:08:10.280
He shouldn't be training in his condition...

00:08:15.990 --> 00:08:17.890
Those are Joe's footsteps!

00:08:22.190 --> 00:08:23.600
Joe!

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:27.400
Joe, you shouldn't be training in your condition!

00:08:31.830 --> 00:08:33.330
Slept in, didn't you?

00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:35.410
No! You can't train yet!

00:08:36.340 --> 00:08:39.410
One little punch isn't enough to keep me down!

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:40.790
I won't stand for this!

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:43.660
Joe, you're forbidden from training for three days!

00:08:45.550 --> 00:08:49.920
Just who was it that said I had to take a tough test to become a pro?

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:53.970
As the coach, it's my decision whether or not you take the test!

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:58.480
Just leave everything to me.

00:08:58.480 --> 00:09:00.570
For now, you need to heal up!

00:09:00.570 --> 00:09:01.430
Got it?

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:03.670
But then my body's gonna get dull...

00:09:04.430 --> 00:09:09.440
Then you can keep yourself in shape by working hard at Hayashi Grocery.

00:09:10.370 --> 00:09:12.440
That's not fair, old man...

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:15.100
Keep a close eye on Joe!

00:09:15.690 --> 00:09:17.450
Got it.

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:19.640
What the hell?

00:09:20.320 --> 00:09:21.460
Goddammit!

00:09:23.110 --> 00:09:25.730
I'd rather be training than doing this...

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:27.890
You're one to talk...

00:09:27.890 --> 00:09:30.460
People gotta work to make a living.

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:33.470
But will this really keep me in shape?

00:09:33.850 --> 00:09:37.470
Don't you think you'll just wear yourself out by training with those injuries?

00:09:38.490 --> 00:09:41.470
You gotta be kidding. What am I, a patient?

00:09:42.710 --> 00:09:43.680
Take a look at this!

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:46.530
Do I look like a patient to you?

00:09:46.530 --> 00:09:47.480
J-Joe!

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:48.630
What now?

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:55.450
What am I gonna do with you?

00:09:56.870 --> 00:09:57.690
Sorry...

00:09:58.700 --> 00:10:02.040
What's done is done. Just get this to Noriko.

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:03.200
Here!

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:04.040
Me?

00:10:04.850 --> 00:10:06.210
Sure...

00:10:17.060 --> 00:10:18.220
One, two, one, two!

00:10:17.730 --> 00:10:18.220
Hey!

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:19.710
Pick up the pace!

00:10:47.100 --> 00:10:50.250
They got it good. Practicing at this time in the day...

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:51.370
Better get going.

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:22.510
So where would Nori-chan be?

00:11:40.510 --> 00:11:41.780
Whoa, there...

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:46.470
Noriko-san! Where are you?

00:11:46.860 --> 00:11:48.540
Hayashi-san, you forgot something!

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:50.480
Hayashi Noriko-san!

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:52.480
Whoa, now...

00:11:54.340 --> 00:11:56.490
Noriko-san! Show yourself!

00:11:56.490 --> 00:11:57.990
Nori-chan!

00:11:58.970 --> 00:12:00.600
Nori-chan!

00:12:01.210 --> 00:12:03.990
Noriko-san! Where are you?

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:05.490
Let me see you!

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:09.500
You forgot something!

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:11.500
Noriko-san!

00:12:12.800 --> 00:12:13.500
Where are you?

00:12:17.910 --> 00:12:19.020
Yabuki-kun!

00:12:19.020 --> 00:12:19.960
There she is!

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:24.010
You don't need to make such a fuss. There's nothing important inside!

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:26.510
What? You want me to show you what's inside?

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:30.020
Let's see... what's in here?

00:12:30.020 --> 00:12:32.480
Don't do it, Yabuki-kun!

00:12:33.160 --> 00:12:35.150
All right! I'll show you!

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:35.920
Here!

00:12:37.950 --> 00:12:39.480
You stupid idiot!

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:41.920
It's her underwear!

00:12:54.260 --> 00:12:55.400
Ow, ow, ow!

00:12:56.940 --> 00:12:57.920
Up I get!

00:13:28.730 --> 00:13:31.040
This doesn't look bad at all.

00:13:31.510 --> 00:13:34.140
It's worlds apart from my ragged old sandbag.

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:42.110
This feels pretty good!

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:56.140
Hey! I don't know who you are, but you're interrupting our practice!

00:13:56.140 --> 00:13:57.850
Get out of here!

00:13:57.850 --> 00:13:59.630
Oh, you're back.

00:13:59.630 --> 00:14:03.860
I didn't really mean to cause trouble, I just wanted to try one of these, just once.

00:14:04.530 --> 00:14:06.480
Well, you got your wish. Now go home.

00:14:07.170 --> 00:14:09.150
Come on, don't be so cold!

00:14:09.150 --> 00:14:11.370
I try to be nice, and you repay me by being cocky!?

00:14:14.760 --> 00:14:15.370
You little...

00:14:22.140 --> 00:14:23.960
Oh, sorry, but you'd better not rush me so suddenly.

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:26.730
Oh, sorry, but you'd better not rush me so suddenly.

00:14:26.730 --> 00:14:29.550
I have reflexes, you see.

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:32.020
How dare you beat up Maruzashi-san!

00:14:32.020 --> 00:14:32.690
You...!

00:14:32.690 --> 00:14:33.950
Stop!

00:14:33.950 --> 00:14:34.680
But...

00:14:35.150 --> 00:14:37.730
This is a sacred dojo! Brawls are not permitted!

00:14:38.360 --> 00:14:41.190
You. You heard me. Just go home.

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:44.690
Fine, fine. I don't have much of a taste for sacred places, anyway.

00:14:45.880 --> 00:14:46.700
Really?

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:49.700
By the way, have you boxed for long?

00:14:51.460 --> 00:14:53.080
Boxing's not a career.

00:14:54.940 --> 00:14:57.160
I like the way you put it!

00:14:57.160 --> 00:15:01.510
Minagaki-senpai was the champion of the High School National Athletic Meeting in boxing!

00:15:01.510 --> 00:15:04.170
No wonder. I had a feeling he was different from the rest of you.

00:15:04.910 --> 00:15:05.960
What the hell...

00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:05.960
<i>Hold it!</i>

00:15:06.570 --> 00:15:07.800
Don't you dare start a fight!

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:13.900
And we're supposed to help him train today one last time before the professional test...

00:15:15.550 --> 00:15:19.810
I see. So this is a pro boxing champion course.

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:22.270
That has nothing to do with you.

00:15:23.260 --> 00:15:26.320
How about, as a little parting gift...

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:31.280
me being your sparring partner, and show everyone here a thing or two?

00:15:32.080 --> 00:15:36.140
I'm sorry, but sparring has no meaning if it's done with an outsider.

00:15:37.970 --> 00:15:41.290
And I don't know how good a boxer you are...

00:15:42.240 --> 00:15:44.390
but you can't do boxing half-heartedly.

00:15:46.770 --> 00:15:49.800
If you get injured, you can't take it back.

00:15:50.330 --> 00:15:51.530
Me? Injured?

00:15:58.210 --> 00:15:59.490
Now, let's begin!

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:02.910
Hey! Get out of here! Now!

00:16:02.910 --> 00:16:04.200
Hands off!

00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:05.360
Don't you dare touch me!

00:16:06.020 --> 00:16:07.820
You're nothing but a club of octopus dancers!

00:16:10.130 --> 00:16:12.670
When you say that boxing isn't half-hearted...

00:16:12.670 --> 00:16:14.620
are you even aware of your own skill?

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:15.950
You talking to me?

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:18.240
Yeah.

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:22.550
You guys are treating boxing just like reading, writing and 'rimetic, right?.

00:16:22.550 --> 00:16:24.170
And you call that real boxing?

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:25.590
Just a bunch of octopus dancers.

00:16:26.240 --> 00:16:27.950
Well, off I go!

00:16:27.010 --> 00:16:27.950
<i>Wait!</i>

00:16:29.100 --> 00:16:29.920
Oh?

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:31.590
Changed your mind?

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:35.370
I understand that you're trying to get me angry so I'll spar with you.

00:16:35.950 --> 00:16:37.790
But that's not the problem here!

00:16:37.790 --> 00:16:41.600
The problem is that you've defiled the very boxing we do!

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:43.100
Yeah.

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:47.110
I want you to see whether or not we're octopus dancers.

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:48.770
That's more like it.

00:16:51.660 --> 00:16:52.240
Up and over...

00:17:00.310 --> 00:17:01.130
Help us get ready.

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:02.000
Yes!

00:17:05.810 --> 00:17:07.000
What the hell are these?

00:17:08.510 --> 00:17:11.010
I don't need anything but these.

00:17:12.280 --> 00:17:14.570
All I need are the gloves.

00:17:16.940 --> 00:17:18.510
I said I don't need it!

00:17:18.940 --> 00:17:22.110
We have to both fight by the amateur rules.

00:17:22.110 --> 00:17:24.890
Those are my conditions to sparring with you.

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:25.520
Let's go.

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:29.020
Fine.

00:17:29.020 --> 00:17:31.030
Start the match!

00:17:57.030 --> 00:17:58.260
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:17:58.260 --> 00:18:00.470
Hey, what's the matter? That was pathetic!

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:02.310
Are these the sparring tips you wanted to give us?

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:03.970
Beat him up, Minagaki-san!

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:05.810
Beat him to the ground!

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:09.380
That was just a test!

00:18:09.380 --> 00:18:10.320
Goddammit...

00:18:17.210 --> 00:18:17.970
Too slow!

00:18:17.970 --> 00:18:19.160
Where are you looking?

00:18:30.360 --> 00:18:32.020
What the hell's that?

00:18:39.640 --> 00:18:41.350
Giving up already?

00:18:41.940 --> 00:18:43.200
What!?

00:18:45.210 --> 00:18:47.020
I haven't even taken any damage!

00:18:48.140 --> 00:18:49.520
Like hell I'm gonna quit!

00:19:18.180 --> 00:19:20.090
Your guard's pretty weak for a pro wannabe.

00:19:22.250 --> 00:19:24.240
Dammit...

00:19:24.240 --> 00:19:25.810
Time out, time out!

00:19:27.860 --> 00:19:31.420
These things are slowing me down!

00:19:32.300 --> 00:19:33.210
And one...

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:35.860
And the other...

00:19:39.850 --> 00:19:40.820
Now I feel better!

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:43.330
Now, let's restart the match!

00:19:43.880 --> 00:19:44.830
I refuse!

00:19:45.730 --> 00:19:46.830
You refuse?

00:19:47.310 --> 00:19:50.330
You promised to abide by the amateur rules!

00:19:51.780 --> 00:19:53.740
Come on, don't be a stiff.

00:19:53.740 --> 00:19:54.830
We're already in the ring.

00:19:55.340 --> 00:19:57.840
We fight by the rules, or else...

00:19:57.840 --> 00:19:59.840
you're disqualified!

00:20:00.240 --> 00:20:01.840
Disqualified!?

00:20:01.840 --> 00:20:02.590
Son of a...

00:20:03.260 --> 00:20:04.600
Wh-What are you doing? Stop!

00:20:05.280 --> 00:20:07.350
What the hell!? Let me go!

00:20:12.320 --> 00:20:15.380
Why don't you drop the whole dojo challenging act, Yabuki-kun?

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:18.480
Yabuki?

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:20.110
H-How did you know my name?

00:20:20.950 --> 00:20:22.690
I just remembered what I read in this morning's paper

00:20:22.690 --> 00:20:25.620
about the passerby-killing boxer Yabuki Joe.

00:20:26.460 --> 00:20:26.930
Yabuki?

00:20:26.930 --> 00:20:28.580
<i>Th-That</i> Yabuki?

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:31.130
Th-The Cross Counter guy?

00:20:31.130 --> 00:20:32.580
Yabuki Joe?

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:33.740
I-It can't be...

00:20:33.740 --> 00:20:36.590
But his punch wasn't half bad!

00:20:37.150 --> 00:20:38.600
But... wh-what could he be doing here?

00:20:38.600 --> 00:20:40.590
But... wh-what could he be doing here?

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:44.560
H-He's smaller than I thought... I don't believe it...

00:20:48.020 --> 00:20:49.560
Thank you, thank you!

00:20:50.400 --> 00:20:54.350
I'm going to take the B-class professional test next Sunday.

00:20:55.430 --> 00:20:56.860
B-class professional test?

00:20:56.860 --> 00:20:59.670
They say you're gearing to be a pro,

00:20:59.670 --> 00:21:01.860
so why don't we fight after that?

00:21:02.730 --> 00:21:03.930
The pro test...

00:21:05.440 --> 00:21:06.320
B-class, eh?

00:21:06.320 --> 00:21:07.620
Yeah.

00:21:08.270 --> 00:21:09.500
All right then.

00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:12.580
A B-class license...

00:21:25.600 --> 00:21:28.640
What? You applied for the pro test?

00:21:29.210 --> 00:21:29.960
Yeah.

00:21:31.680 --> 00:21:33.350
Don't "yeah" me!

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:34.600
Joe, what are you, insane?

00:21:35.120 --> 00:21:36.110
Of course I'm sane.

00:21:36.700 --> 00:21:39.610
Hey, Nishi! I applied for you, too!

00:21:40.260 --> 00:21:42.730
And just so you know, we're not going for the C-class.

00:21:42.730 --> 00:21:45.150
We're going straight for the B-class license.

00:21:45.620 --> 00:21:47.660
B... B-class!?

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:50.120
B-class!?

00:21:50.120 --> 00:21:51.400
Th-That's just crazy!

00:21:51.400 --> 00:21:55.700
You have to fight not just four, but six rounds for the B-class test!

00:21:57.290 --> 00:21:59.130
Got a problem with that?

00:21:59.870 --> 00:22:03.520
You're going to take the super-difficult B-class test in just three days!?

00:22:04.090 --> 00:22:06.140
How could you!

00:22:06.730 --> 00:22:08.190
Old man.

00:22:08.190 --> 00:22:11.140
I wasn't trying to do anything bad...

00:22:11.900 --> 00:22:14.640
You moron! Don't you see? You did do something bad!

00:22:15.750 --> 00:22:20.710
The B-class test is so difficult that even Sakurai Takao barely managed to pass,

00:22:20.710 --> 00:22:25.390
and he won 124 out of 136 matches in his amateur career,

00:22:25.390 --> 00:22:29.610
and took the silver medal in the Tokyo Olympics!

00:22:29.610 --> 00:22:31.120
And now you...

00:22:31.120 --> 00:22:34.830
Well, I'm taking it. Don't underestimate your pupil.

00:22:42.850 --> 00:22:45.100
From the way I beat Wolf,

00:22:45.100 --> 00:22:46.630
I'd say I'm on pro level.

00:22:46.630 --> 00:22:50.640
In fact, I'd say I could even take the A-class test.

00:22:55.720 --> 00:22:56.890
There's someone waiting for me...

00:22:58.410 --> 00:22:59.850
at the exam grounds.

00:23:32.960 --> 00:23:36.740
Joe has finally reached the stairway to glory.

00:23:36.740 --> 00:23:41.030
But another obstacle stands in Joe's way of becoming a pro.

00:23:41.030 --> 00:23:43.640
His B-class license as a pro boxer...

00:23:43.640 --> 00:23:46.600
is not something he can attain half-heartedly.

00:23:46.600 --> 00:23:52.920
But, Joe applied for a B-class license without even consulting me.

00:23:52.920 --> 00:23:58.140
Now Joe is determined to overcome this challenge!

00:23:58.140 --> 00:24:01.210
Now, for Joe, who aims for the pro test...

00:24:01.210 --> 00:24:03.080
which way is tomorrow!?
